<GdsHeading Level="1">Start Button</GdsHeading>

<p class="govuk-body">
    This component allows you to add start buttons to any part of your Blazor application using the various GDS styles.
</p>

<GdsHeading Level="2">Examples</GdsHeading>

<div><GdsStartButton /></div>
<div><GdsStartButton Text="Go to buttons page" Href="button" /></div>
<div>
    The start button style is actually a styled link element so we have put regular button elements in the button component.
    Please head to the <a href="button" class="govuk-link">button demo</a> for information on this component.
</div>